-alabama-touchdown","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Singing “Yea, Alabama” After Touchdowns","title":"Learn “Yea, Alabama” for touchdowns","subtitle":"Crimson Tide sporting events","notes":"Use the Bands page to learn the official fight-song words, then follow the crowd and band at a game rather than adding unofficial or altered lyrics.","short_summary":"Fans sing the official fight song after Alabama touchdowns with the Million Dollar Band.","evidence_claim":"UA Student Affairs calls it a treasured tradition for Crimson Tide fans to sing the fight song after every Alabama touchdown.","source_url":"https://abook.sa.ua.edu/ua-traditions/history/million-dollar-band/","source_title":"Million Dollar Band | A-Book","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Game admission policies vary by sport and event; official lyrics are available from UA Bands.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
